          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grove is a focus timer that grows a tree while you stay present. We designed Grove to work without an account and without tracking you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grove is a focus timer that grows a tree while you stay present. We designed Grove to work without an account and without tracking you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grove 是一款专注计时工具：你保持专注时，小树会生长。我们设计 Grove 无需账号，也不会追踪你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data we store on your device": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data we store on your device"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们在你设备上存储的数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Focus sessions (time, tree species, tags, grown or wilted), your settings (default duration, leave-grace seconds), and whether you unlocked Lifetime are saved locally with Apple’s on-device storage (SwiftData / similar). This data stays on your device unless you back up or transfer the device with your own Apple tools.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Focus sessions (time, tree species, tags, grown or wilted), your settings (default duration, leave-grace seconds), and whether you unlocked Lifetime are saved locally with Apple’s on-device storage (SwiftData / similar). This data stays on your device unless you back up or transfer the device with your own Apple tools."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专注记录（时长、树种、标签、长成或枯萎）、设置（默认时长、离开宽限秒数）以及是否解锁终身版，会保存在设备本地（SwiftData 等）。除非你用自己的 Apple 工具备份或迁移设备，这些数据不会离开本机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Data we do not collect": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Data we do not collect"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们不收集的数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We do not run analytics SDKs, do not use advertising identifiers, do not sell personal data, and do not require an account or email. Grove does not send your focus history to our servers because we do not operate a Grove cloud for this app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We do not run analytics SDKs, do not use advertising identifiers, do not sell personal data, and do not require an account or email. Grove does not send your focus history to our servers because we do not operate a Grove cloud for this app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们不接入分析 SDK，不使用广告标识符，不出售个人数据，也不要求账号或邮箱。Grove 不会把你的专注历史发送到我们的服务器，因为本 App 不运营 Grove 云端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lifetime unlock is processed by Apple through StoreKit / App Store. Apple handles payment details under Apple’s privacy policy. Grove only receives an entitlement signal that you own the product so locked trees and Month/Year stats can unlock on this device (and restore on your other devices signed into the same Apple ID).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lifetime unlock is processed by Apple through StoreKit / App Store. Apple handles payment details under Apple’s privacy policy. Grove only receives an entitlement signal that you own the product so locked trees and Month/Year stats can unlock on this device (and restore on your other devices signed into the same Apple ID)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终身解锁通过 Apple 的 StoreKit / App Store 处理。支付信息由 Apple 按其隐私政策管理。Grove 仅收到你已拥有该产品的权益信号，以便在本机解锁树种与月度/年度统计（并在同一 Apple ID 的其他设备上恢复）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Notifications": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you allow notifications, Grove may schedule a local alert when a focus session is due to finish. Notification permission is optional and managed in iOS Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you allow notifications, Grove may schedule a local alert when a focus session is due to finish. Notification permission is optional and managed in iOS Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若你允许通知，Grove 可能在专注结束时发送本地提醒。通知权限可选，可在 iOS 设置中管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Children": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
